lakṣaṇaṃ caiva vakṣāmi narānāṃ hṛtakāmayā |
jena vijñātamātrena śaṃkṣepena tu vistara ||
lakṣaṇaṃ sādhayet sarvvaṃ deva prāsādanirmmitaṃ |
suvarṇatāmrarajataṃ lohapāṣānadārubhi ||
mṛtmayapate cārthaṃ patimākāraye buddhaṃ |
