<p. 20b> (* *?) me vāyuśca saṃcālaṃ sūryarasmaiṣu dṛṣṭayaṃ ||
renusūṣmarajañcaiva atiśukṣmeti sūkṣmakaṃ |
renu cāṣṭavirenuśca virenu cāṣṭa eḍakaṃ ||
eḍacāṣṭaka vārāgraṃ vārāgra cāṣṭa ṛkṣakaṃ |
ṛkṣa cāṣṭayukānāñca jukācāṣṭa javastathā ||
java cāṣṭāṅgulī proktāṃ karmmasya paridhīyate |
dvādaśāṃgulibhitāraṃ tārasyādhiguṇahastayo ||
catuhaṣṭa dhanudandaddhe sahaśrañca kāsakaṃ |
catrusahaśragaṃbuti tadugnaṃ jojanākitaṃ ||
evamādi kramenaiva jñātavyañcaiva mudhitaṃ |
nagnodhamiti vakāryañca maṇḍapaṃ parijojiyaṃ ||
ghanoghokhyā(?) virājambakañca kāmabījakaṃ |
śupe sope savo dakṣo maṇḍapā navanāmataṃ ||
jāvatkājyaṃ tāvat dhyānaṃ pūjā ca patimākṛti |
sāṅgopāṅgavayaṣṭā ca jāvaṃ paralitābudi ||
tirabimbā mudhrokāraṃ locanī deva netrake |
vatulaṃ krodhanetraṃ ca sarvve paryāya vācake ||
chatrākāra śiraskaṃdha hastapādāṅgamānajaṃ |
śusaṃśitaprasaṃśitya lakṣaṇaṃ samudāhṛtaṃ ||
nāti sthulaṃ na kṛkṣantu nāti dīrgha na ṣarvvajā |
ratāramā na kṛtaṃ joryañca tuṅgapināṅgakāṅgakaṃ ||
sthula sthulāṅga kāṅgantu tatmāna krarmayojitaṃ |
devatā deva śūdhā yejo janipāśvaṣudhimān ||

<p. 21a> kesare khānta pādāntaṃ yojaniyāśca lakṣaṇaṃ |
yavacāṣṭaṃ gurijeṣṭā yava saptāstu madhyamā ||
yavaṣaṣṭha kanistāyāṃ tāṅguri trividhiyate |
jeṣṭamadhyakaniṣṭhāyāṃ triviyā kṛkṣa ca mānakaṃ ||
tṛpanti māna devasya pārthivañca kṛte 'pu ca |
caturāśraya mānañca pūjitaṃ yava cāṣṭakaṃ ||
jeṣṭamadhyakaniṣṭhāyāṃ cāṣṭavarṇṇanijojitaṃ |
jeṣṭāṅguriśca saṃpūrṇaṃ aṣṭajava vinirdṛset ||
madhyamā java saptāśca bhaṃjitaṃ cāṣṭajojitaṃ |
kaniyaśiti ṣaṣṭhaṃ ca bhajitaṃ cāṣṭakaṃ vidu ||
bhaṃjitaṃ na samāyā ca trividhāgulimeva ca |
lakṣaneva samāyā ca javamakṣeṇa jojitaṃ |
gatitaṃ caturbhitatvaṃ pithivyākāsa varjitaṃ |
pañcabhuta tatheveti athavārtha tribhutake ||
svarasca caturbhibhutaṃ pṛthivyādistathaiva ca |
śubhaṃ pṛthvī sthiraṃ caiva āpaśca āpaghātakaṃ ||
kupatāri tarāgāni lakṣaṇaṃ jojayedbudhaṃ |
tejaśca tejavṛdhiṃ syāt patāpārtha tatheva ca ||
pākasārāgni kuṇḍāni jojitavyañca tejasu |
vāyuśca vāyughāṭaśca prāsādā deva māhṛtī ||
dhvajaṃ patāka jojyāni jojaniyāstathaiva ca |
ākāsa ca phalaṃ śūnyaṃ ganitaśca śubhāśubhaṃ ||
abja ṛṣabha śādhā (*?) madhya pañcābhi tathā |

<p. 21b> (*?) vatasya niśādaśca svarā sapta prakirtitā ||
lakṣmīpa (*?) bhaveṣabja gādhāṃrojana vṛdhita |
pañcama śrīparānityaṃ bhumilābha karo nṛnāṃ ||
ṛṣabho nāri vṛddhi syāt madhye me śu (*?) nāsa kṛta |
dhavatena kṣayaṃ kartu nisāda sarvvaśāsanaṃ ||
dhvajadhumañca svānavṛṣakharastathā | 
gajadhvāṃkṣa tu cāṣṭaṃ ca aṣṭavargga vinidṛset ||
pūrvvadhvaja garuḍātmā ca puṃśameva vinidṛset |
dhumāgnaya viḍārasya jojātāṃgāmanekhu ca |
dakṣiṇe śiṃhamṛtyāhu purukhaṃ ca tathaiva ca |
nai(-)ṛte śvāṇakukuraṃ strīyāsaṃ kathyate vaca ||
varuṇaṃ vṛṣāhiṣṭaṃ sāśavāyo strī kharadhvajaṃ |
uttare gajamityāhu punsameva madhimate ||
iśāna dhvākṣameṣaśca strīgaṇaṃ ca tathaiva ca |
dhvajādyādigiṣṭha puruśaṃ dhumājñāśca strīyāṅgaṇā ||
evaṃ viddhiśca vargāśca śivasakti tathaiva ca |
satvavirādhena kartavyaṃ digabhedana kārayeta ||
dhvajavṛṣana kartavya gajaśiṃha na kārayet |
dhvaja śiṃha ca saṃjojyā śiṃhadhvaja tathaiva ca ||
śiṃhavṛṣasaṃjojya vṛṣasiṃha tathāpi vā |
vṛṣagaja vinidṛṣṭaṃ gajavṛṣanijyojitaṃ ||
gajadhvaja tathaiveti dhvajaṃ gajañca mādiset |
aṅgulidhvaja kartavyaṃ javaśiṃha tathaiva ca ||
idaṃ krehāsabudhidvyājñāyatā cārjyabuddhimāṃ |
dhūmena jayaśaṃha dṛstvā(?) pākagniñcaiva kraṇḍaya ||


<p. 22a> svāne ceva tathaiveti vajyāsārāstathaiva ca |
kharaṃ dṛtvā vicādābhyo sārāyāñca tathaiva ca |
hiraṃ nyāsyārātusārāyāṃ dṛtvā dhvākṣañca budhimā |
imā jajñāyate krama aśurijava(?) dṛṣaya(?) ||
unādhikaṃ javāgulyaḥ hastāyāṃgurikastathā |
tatkrame hrāsabudhyāye jojritavyaṃ prayatnataṃ ||
utisthaṃ dhvajakatravyaṃ vartulaṃ vṛṣajojitaṃ |
pūrvvādyāmuśubhaṃ vindyāta jojanīyā śubhaṃ sadā ||
tri ekapañcasaptā ca javahīna śubhaṃkari |
aṣṭādi karāṇāñca śubhaṃkari cāstakaṃ ||
avirodhena katravyaṃ virodhañca na kārayet |
dhvajādi dhvākṣa prajyaṃ vairi bhedana kārayet |
yathā devākṣa tvāṅgantu tathaiva jajamānakaṃ ||
devasya jajamānasya dvayo vairi na kārayet |
śubhaṃkari klesakari dvitiyā śriyaṃkarimāradhanaṃkari ca |
hāranya śubhagā tathāpi ṣiṣaniyarvāhi cāṣṭāyiti jojaniyā ||
dhvaja viprasya jātināṃ śiṃhakṣatriyameva ca |
vṛṣavaisya (* *?) tukṣaṃ gajaśudra viddhiyate ||
dhvaje rājye jayaśiṃhe vṛkṣarāje śriye gaje |
dhumedā ghasvāne mṛtu khare nocātane sadā |
dhvākṣana sarvvanāsasyā tasmātoparivarjjayet ||
dhvaje ca saṃpatiṃ jñātvā jayorthā siṃhamādṛset ||
vṛṣe dhānyāthā kaṃceva gaje paśutāraka |
agnitejavatiścaiva svāne ca jyādikā jaya ||
khare vicāra śiddhiṃ tu dhvāmkṣa(?) hi (* *?) di śiddhidaṃ |

<p. 22b> evaṃ mādini cihnāni lakṣaṇaṃ samudāhitaṃ || 
